$MDESC::Desc = "Vehicle Training";
$MDESC::Planet = "unknown";
$MDESC::TeamCount = "1";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f5>The Slopes\n\n<f4>A favored practice location of the pro's, this track was built for training purposes. During the Great War, this particular stretch of snow and ice played host to the Battle of Sorrow, a three-year long conflict which was the result of two opposing battalions, both stranded on the planet. The bloody fight raged on until, eventually, most of the combatants were either killed or starved to death. Anyone who survived eventually froze to death. Hence, the name, Battle of Sorrows. Presently, the descendants of the warriors who died here honor them by honing their skills so they may prove a worthy opponent themselves, not on the battlefield, but in the Snowboarding Circuit. Living proof that life does go on.";
$MDESC::TimeOfDay = "Midday";
$MDESC::Type = "Snowboarding";
$MDESC::Weather = "Snowing";











